  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The first stable release of IndxSearchLib 5. The code is the same as 5.0.0-RC031026; what has\n      changed since 4.x is the whole of this file, and the [migration guide](https://github.com/indxSearch/skill-indx-search/blob/main/references/migration-v4-to-v5.md)\n      lists what to change in your code. Coming from a 5.0 release candidate, read the sections below\n      from the one you have up to here: the last ones fixed sorting by decimals on servers set to a\n      comma-decimal language, made inserts refuse fields the configuration does not know, and removed\n      the separate Hibernated state.\n      \n      Highlights of 5.0:\n      \n      - Insert, update and delete documents while the engine keeps serving, with no rebuild.\n      - Hybrid search: text and vector scores blended, over embeddings you bring.\n      - BM25F scoring across fields, with per-field weights and per-query field boosts.\n      - Synonyms, two-way and one-way.\n      - 16-bit scores, less memory per search, and faster indexing.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "IndxSearchLib",
  "verbatimVersion": "5.0.0",
